# A head held or blocked (a cover, a hand, the wall: every switch-on hangs) for 10 minutes: power cycles must back off
# (3 within 3 minutes, then a wait of 1, 2, 5 ... minutes - each one is a current surge), and the head moves again
# once it is free.
duration 20:00
clock 12:00
seed 6
window 170 20 40 30
lamp desk 100 12 on
at 2:00 fault servo 1
at 12:00 fault servo off
